{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Measurement Precision as Cluster Resolution.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Measurement Precision as Cluster Resolution.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"measurement precision as cluster resolution measurement precision as cluster resolution","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Measurement Precision as Cluster Resolution.md","fileName":"Measurement Precision as Cluster Resolution.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Measurement Precision as Cluster Resolution","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-15 10:23\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Scalable Hierarchical Search]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Scalable Hierarchical Search","datasciencefoundations_geometry.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Measurement Precision as Cluster Resolution.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Measurement Precision as Cluster Resolution.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"measurement precision as cluster resolution measurement precision as cluster resolution","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Measurement Precision as Cluster Resolution.md","fileName":"Measurement Precision as Cluster Resolution.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Measurement Precision as Cluster Resolution","heading":"Measurement Precision as Cluster Resolution","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"In a longest-common-prefix hierarchy, the number of retained digits sets cluster resolution. Sharing one digit creates broad bins; sharing several creates more selective bins. Reducing recorded precision can thus make values equal at a coarse level and induce a more visibly hierarchical representation.\n\nThe book demonstrates this with chemical fingerprints recoded at different precisions. The effect is partly a consequence of encoding, not a discovery independent of the measure